{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>StackShot: Photo Video Cleaner 是一款以私隱為先的相片清理工具，適合相簿堆滿重複相片、舊截圖與模糊相片的用家。它會在 iPhone 本機分析相片與影片，找出值得檢視的項目，再由你決定去留。原價 US $4.99 的終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，內購限時免費期間可免費收下。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-191.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>本機分析找出重複相片</h2>\n<p>StackShot 在本機分析相簿，找出重複與相似相片，於每組標示最佳一張，並篩走舊截圖與模糊相片，列出大型相片、影片與 Live Photos。你可滑動檢視、並排比較或批次選取，刪除前必須確認，亦可撤回選擇。合資格檔案可壓縮節省空間，Live Photos 可轉為靜態相片，分析全程在 iPhone 完成。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-34.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-35.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-36.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-37.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-38.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-39.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>StackShot: Photo Video Cleaner 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：StackShot: Photo Video Cleaner</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/stackshot-photo-video-cleaner/id6775247259\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T09:22:49.165620+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":505,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T09:01:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T09:16:13.993658+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:16:13.993658+00:00","content_hash":"5e56c183df2f2017ae2017dd2c5a3e72535d02c631479767c2701f921a8a75cf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}